DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED
---------------------

Assets/Animated Loading Icons/ is a Unity Asset Store pack. The Asset Store EULA licenses
it per-seat and does not permit redistribution, so it is gitignored and is not part of
this repository. A clone will not have it, and MainMenu.unity will show missing sprite
and animation references until it is supplied.

If you own the pack, Tools/import-local-assets.sh copies it in from a local reference
checkout. If you do not, substitute your own loading art.


